stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CollectBefore
    CollectBefore --> Down: crash discards memory proof
    Down --> CollectBefore: boot and fresh process identity
    CollectBefore --> CollectAfter: progress or identity change
    CollectAfter --> Admit: stable projection and fences
    CollectAfter --> CollectBefore: changed inputs, one retry
    CollectAfter --> Unbound: guard/read fault or second failure
    Unbound --> Unknown: present inflight blocks absence
    Unknown --> Notice: continuous Unknown reaches grace
    Unknown --> CollectBefore: next read
    Admit --> ReadOpen
    ReadOpen --> PublicationPair
    PublicationPair --> FinalFiles: fresh and pinned projection agree
    FinalFiles --> Publish: same identity and fences
    FinalFiles --> CollectBefore: changed identity or read failure
    Publish --> CollectBefore: next read
